 "notes": {
  "dkt": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 1400,
   "page": "dockai",
   "text": "Bottom dock layout \u00b7 PayPal AI chat open",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -140
  },
  "fintro": {
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "Every screen of the Clean prototype, grouped by flow and read left to right. Each frame is the live prototype opened on that exact state. Numbers match the list beside each row.",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": -260
  },
  "fn0": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "Home is the starting point. PayPal AI opens beside the rail, not over the page, and answers with sources and next steps.\n\n1. Home\n2. Open PayPal AI \u00b7 starter prompts\n3. Ask \u00b7 answer with sources and actions",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 0
  },
  "fn1": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "Move money in from the balance card. A sheet picks the amount; a toast confirms, the balance updates, and the top up is recorded in Transactions as a positive inflow.\n\n1. Home \u00b7 balance card\n2. Add money to PayPal\n3. Added \u00b7 toast and new balance\n4. Recorded in Transactions \u00b7 inflow",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 1400
  },
  "fn10": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "The AI panel stays open beside whichever page the user is on, so answers can point at what is on screen.\n\n1. Dining \u00b7 on Transactions\n2. What\u2019s due \u00b7 on Recurring\n3. Reorder \u00b7 on Essentials\n4. Can I afford\u2026 \u00b7 on Wallet\n5. Cancel \u00b7 on Recurring",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 14000
  },
  "fn11": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "The avatar at the bottom of the rail opens Settings: profile details, security, notification and PayPal AI preferences.\n\n1. Settings",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 15400
  },
  "fn12": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "Budget is a rail page with two sections, Essentials and Spending: editable amounts, an Add category button under each, and an x to remove a row (with a confirm dialog). A summary ring shows what is left. PayPal AI can suggest limits in chat or on the page; nothing changes until the user applies it.\n\n1. Budget\n2. AI suggestions\n3. Suggest in chat\n4. Applied\n5. Add a category\n6. Remove a category\n7. Category details",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 16800
  },
  "fn2": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "Find, filter and understand any transaction. Charges PayPal AI can\u2019t categorise get a review prompt.\n\n1. Transactions \u00b7 chart and list\n2. Category filter menu\n3. Filtered to Dining\n4. Transaction details panel\n5. Change category \u00b7 picker\n6. Category saved \u00b7 toast\n7. Needs-review charge\n8. Page 2 of results",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 2800
  },
  "fn3": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "PayPal AI\u2019s agent (Kernel) cancels in a secure cloud browser, only after the user approves, and leaves proof and an undo.\n\n1. Recurring \u00b7 subscriptions and bills\n2. Subscription details panel\n3. Confirm cancellation\n4. Kernel run \u00b7 live browser and steps\n5. Cancelled \u00b7 toast with Undo\n6. Cancelled state \u00b7 proof",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 4200
  },
  "fn4": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "flows",
   "text": "See what is due by day, and inspect a bill (bills are tracked, never suggested for cancelling).\n\n1. Payment calendar \u00b7 day selected\n2. Bill details panel",
