  "p3intro": {
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "AI in context: the PayPal AI panel working next to real screens. Each flow pairs a passive Read screen with an agentic Act conversation, then the result.",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": -260
  },
  "p3n0": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "The AI panel stays open beside whichever page the user is on, so answers can point at what is on screen. (Copy of the flow on the previous page.)\n\n1. Dining \u00b7 on Transactions\n2. What\u2019s due \u00b7 on Recurring",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 0
  },
  "p3n2": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a calendar widget of upcoming free trial expiry dates.\nAct: the user asks to start a trial without being charged; the agent starts it, pays with PayPal and schedules an automatic cancellation the day before the first $49.99 charge.\n\n1. Read \u00b7 Free trials calendar widget\n2. Act \u00b7 Agent starts the trial, schedules auto-cancel\n3. Result \u00b7 Trial on Recurring, auto-cancel set",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 1400
  },
  "p3n5": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a push notification about a suspicious $450 charge.\nAct: \u201cThat wasn\u2019t me.\u201d The agent freezes the debit card, files an unauthorized-transaction claim and orders a replacement card. The PayPal balance keeps working online meanwhile.\n\n1. Read \u00b7 Suspicious charge notification\n2. Act \u00b7 Agent freezes, files the claim, orders a new card\n3. Result \u00b7 Frozen card, replacement ordered",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 2800
  },
  "p3n7": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a list showing the user pays $22.99 a month for Cinebox Premium.\nAct: \u201cDowngrade my Cinebox to the $6.99 ad-supported tier.\u201d The agent changes the tier in the billing portal instead of cancelling.\n\n1. Read \u00b7 Premium plan at $22.99/mo\n2. Act \u00b7 Agent switches to the ad-supported tier\n3. Result \u00b7 Subscription at $6.99/mo",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 4200
  },
  "p3n8": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: the subscription\u2019s details on Recurring.\nAct: \u201cCancel my Vantage subscription.\u201d The agent explains it will open the merchant\u2019s site in a secure browser, and nothing changes until the user approves.\nApprove: the user reviews and confirms in a dialog.\nAct: the agent works through the merchant\u2019s cancellation steps and the user watches each one.\nResult: Vantage is cancelled, a confirmation number and screenshot are saved, and Undo stays available.\n\n1. Read\n2. Ask\n3. Approve\n4. Run\n5. Result",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 5600
  },
  "p3n9": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: the Budget page shows $779.19 left this month.\nAsk: \u201cWhat if I skip dining out for the rest of October?\u201d The agent projects to Oct 31 and shows Now beside What if, with the change in each row.\nAsk: \u201cWhat if I buy a $900 laptop today?\u201d The side-by-side shows it would pass the $3,000 card limit, and suggests an alternative.\nResult: the user applies the first scenario as a lower dining limit, and the Budget page reflects it.\n\n1. Read\n2. Skip dining\n3. Buy a laptop\n4. Apply",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 7000
  },
  "p3t0": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7640,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "PayPal AI in context",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -260
  },
  "p3t2": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 4520,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "1. Subscription Trial Defense",
